function expandedLessonsForDate(date){const day=['SUNDAY','MONDAY','TUESDAY','WEDNESDAY','THURSDAY','FRIDAY','SATURDAY'][new Date(date+'T12:00:00').getDay()],rows=(ALL_TT&&ALL_TT.rows||[]).filter(r=>norm(r.day_of_week)===day),assign=FAST&&FAST.assignments||[],out=[];rows.forEach(r=>{const cc=norm(r.class_code);let cand=assign.filter(a=>String(a.subject_id)===String(r.subject_id)&&String(a.class_code)===String(r.class_code));const m=cc.match(/^([NPS]\d)AB$/);if(m)cand=assign.filter(a=>String(a.subject_id)===String(r.subject_id)&&[m[1]+'A',m[1]+'B'].includes(norm(a.class_code)));if(!cand.length)cand=[{class_id:r.class_id,class_code:r.class_code,subject_id:r.subject_id,subject_name:r.subject_name}];cand.forEach(a=>out.push({class_id:a.class_id,class_code:a.class_code,subject_id:r.subject_id,subject_name:r.subject_name,period_id:r.period_id,start_time:r.start_time,end_time:r.end_time,lesson_number:r.lesson_number}))});return out.sort((a,b)=>String(a.start_time).localeCompare(String(b.start_time))||String(a.class_code).localeCompare(String(b.class_code)))}
